        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Senses are like a rock that has fallen into a torrent, corroded and washed away by the mud over countless years."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 4,
        "ActionId": 4,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The numerous scars on your body are taking their toll on you. If this goes on, you will lose your sanity."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 5,
        "ActionId": 5,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "How did you manage to maintain your most basic form? The flickering light could no longer gather its thoughts to ponder such a question."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 6,
        "ActionId": 6,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "In the memories that you have collected, one thing is for sure... You are reliving Liv's past."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 7,
        "ActionId": 7,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "She too was once lost in the sea of memories and death, struggling, pierced, and torn apart."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 8,
        "ActionId": 8,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "...Liv.",
            9
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liv...",
            10
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
