        "Params": [
            "",
            "...",
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "You have lost count of how many times you call her."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "In this muddy torrent, every effort you make will end up in vain."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "And things stay that way for a long, long time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Following the muddy torrent of data, you drift toward the end of the world... until you feel the wind that carries a soft singing voice."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "It is supposed to be a lullaby, but instead, it awakens those who lie dormant."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "It is supposed to be a song sung in a cage, but instead, it delivers the key of freedom to the imprisoned."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Following the singing voice to its source, you realize this empty world is slowly growing realistic. The souls drifting in chaos have finally found a safe haven to rest their weary minds."
        ]
    },
