    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "...She is just like the bird in the cage."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The nightmare is never gone. She just covers it up with her own dream."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "...",
            31
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The memories of awakening to reality and the echoes once lingering in the void are calling to you."
